# gateway.suite — a NAT'd node reaches its swarm through a gateway node.
#
# gateway-relay moves node2 behind NAT and configures the reflector as its
# gateway, and nothing puts either back; gateway-unregistered-advertise then
# stops the gateway, so the two end their world. It has a suite
# of its own because each VM suite is one world's worth of VM time.
bootstrap-user-software-key
adopt-node
gateway-relay
gateway-unregistered-advertise
